2026-07-27T11:46:47.6959624Z i /tmp/Rtmpxor1FR/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:46:47.6959938Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:46:47.6960301Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:46:47.6960615Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:46:47.6961435Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:46:47.6962237Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:46:47.6962939Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
